+  \item state micro-Doppler sampling limits and avoid measured-signature language;
+  \item make the fixed-wing pusher-prop proxy an appendix card with prohibited inferences;
+  \item enumerate thermal/SNR, Weibull/K-like clutter, weather, sea, terrain, multipath, RFI, AGC, drift, quantization, dropped-CPI, Doppler-folding, and calibration-offset stressors;
+  \item use group-locked Monte Carlo splits and group-block uncertainty.
+\end{enumerate}
