+# EchoForge Tier-1 Paper Upgrade Spec
+
+This repo-local spec is generated from the same review plan as `echoforge_tier1_engineering_spec.md`.
+
+## Goals
+
+1. Make the paper readable in the order a radar reviewer expects: claim boundary, scenario setup, waveform/resolution budget, synthetic IQ/cue generation, detector-view conversion, detector processing, accepted fusion, EI, then limitations.
+2. Add explicit evidence artifacts for simulation best practices, Monte Carlo setup, detector processing, sensor fusion, EI iteration/lock evidence, source-code appendix inventory, and encrypted IP redaction.
+3. Replace scattered result graphics with a familiar progression figure: three human radar branches, accepted fusion, and EI by take-up/climb/cruise phase.
+4. Add a one-column appendix with CLI commands, code-provenance key, full source listings, and high-IP encryption notice.
+
+## Non-goals
+
+No new performance number is claimed by this patch. It does not tune detectors, regenerate benchmark data, or alter the locked holdout. Multi-seed runs, hardware-in-loop validation, and track-level FAR remain future work unless new evidence is generated.
+
+## Acceptance commands
+
+```bash
+rtk python3 -m detection.paper_evidence_major_upgrade_v1 --force
+rtk python3 paper/generate_figures_major_upgrade_v2.py --strict
+rtk python3 paper/validate_visuals.py
+rtk bash paper/build.sh --copy-tracked
+rtk python3 paper/validate_paper.py \
+  --tex paper/echoforge_ieee.tex \
+  --bib paper/references.bib \
+  --pdf paper/echoforge_ieee.pdf \
+  --figures-dir paper/figures \
+  --paper-evidence-root outputs/paper-evidence/major-upgrade-v1
+```
+
+## Expected new artifacts
+
+- `signal_simulation_best_practice_rows.csv`
+- `monte_carlo_scenario_trace_rows.csv`
+- `detector_processing_best_practice_rows.csv`
+- `sensor_fusion_pipeline_rows.csv`
+- `ei_iteration_trace_rows.csv`
+- `source_code_appendix_inventory.csv`
+- `encrypted_ip_redaction_rows.csv`
+- `method_progression_ladder.pdf/.png`
+- `detector_source_lookup.pdf/.png`
+- `ei_iteration_progress.pdf/.png`
+
+## Rust changes
+
+No Rust changes are required for the paper artifact path. The existing Studio can review generated outputs through run/artifact endpoints. Add a Rust endpoint only if the UI must browse the new paper evidence CSVs directly.
